From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: simple-framebuffer: describe backlight

A firmware-configured display can have an independently controlled
backlight. Describe it with the standard optional backlight phandle so
its illumination can follow the framebuffer display state. This does not
imply control of the firmware-owned panel, display controller or their
scanout configuration.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/simple-framebuffer.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/simple-framebuffer.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/simple-framebuffer.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/simple-framebuffer.yaml
@@ -118,6 +118,10 @@
       - x8r8g8b8
       - x8b8g8r8
 
+  backlight:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description: Backlight associated with the firmware framebuffer
+
   display:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
     description: Primary display hardware node
-- 
